<title>FRANCE: EU clears bids to export 20,000 tonnes flour - ONIC.</title>
<headline>EU clears bids to export 20,000 tonnes flour - ONIC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has accepted bids by European firms to export 20,000 tonnes of soft wheat flour under licences carrying a 26.50 Ecu per tonne refund, France's ONIC grain office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bids were placed through France last Friday after the EU raised the daily refund on exports of soft wheat flour to 26.50 Ecus from 24.50.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
